abstract: "Fully autonomous agentic research. For every q >= 1 there is a full-rank product-Bell-diagonal bipartite state, in local dimension 2^((2q+4)4^q), whose level-(q+1) value in the upper PPT entanglement-cost hierarchy of Lami, Mele and Regula is strictly smaller than its level-q value. Hence no fixed finite upper level is exact for all states. Lean proofs are included. Dev D. Goyal is responsible for publication. No expert validation or peer review is claimed."
